# Tab Snoozer → Files (required)

After **any** change under `tab-snoozer/` (code, store docs, manifest, or packaging), you MUST publish the store zip to Cursor Files before ending the turn.

## Required command

```bash
./tab-snoozer/build-store-zip.sh
```

## Required outcomes (verify with `ls`)

These must exist under `/opt/cursor/artifacts/`:

- `TabSnoozer-<version>-store.zip` (version from `tab-snoozer/manifest.json`)
- `TabSnoozer-store.zip` (stable alias)
- `TabSnoozer.zip` (stable alias)
- `TabSnoozer-LATEST.txt` (points at the current versioned store zip)

If the user asks for the zip / Files / store package, run the script even when no code changed.

## Response requirement

When packaging mattered this turn, include a direct Files link to the versioned store zip, e.g. `[TabSnoozer-1.8.3-store.zip](/opt/cursor/artifacts/TabSnoozer-1.8.3-store.zip)`.

Do not say the zip is ready unless `ls` confirms the file exists in `/opt/cursor/artifacts/`.
